«
@@ ============================================================
@@ VnPlot — the maneuver and gust envelope of an airplane: the V-n
@@ diagram of 14 CFR Part 23 before amendment 23-64 (2017).
@@
@@ Input:  Wt Sw — the mass, or a weight such as 2450_lbf, and the wing area;
@@         CLmax CLmxn — the maximum and most negative lift coefficients;
@@         nlim kneg — the limit load factor, and nneg over it;
@@         kVC kVD — the factors of the design speeds;
@@         cgeo CLa — the mean geometric chord and the lift slope of the
@@         wing, per radian, for the gusts.
@@         Values with units are converted; plain numbers are in SI units.
@@ Output: Vst, VA, VC, VD, in knots, equivalent airspeed; nGC and nGD,
@@         the load factors in an upward gust of 50 ft/s at VC and 25 ft/s
@@         at VD; tagged. The diagram stays on the screen until the next
@@         key: solid for the maneuvers, thin for the gusts.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ ============================================================
  → wtm swa clp cln nli kng kvc kvd cgm cla
  «
    IF cln 0 ≥ THEN "VnPlot: the most negative lift coefficient must be negative" DoError END
    wtm
    IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN
      IF DUP 1_kg / UBASE TypeName "unit" ≠ THEN
        1_kg CONVERT UVAL →Num 9.80665 *
      ELSE
        IF DUP 1_N / UBASE TypeName "unit" ≠ THEN
          1_N CONVERT UVAL →Num
        ELSE
          "VnPlot: Wt must be a mass or a weight" DoError
        END
      END
    ELSE
      →Num 9.80665 *
    END
    swa IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_m^2 CONVERT UVAL END →Num
    cgm IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_m CONVERT UVAL END →Num
    → wnw sqm cgb
    «
      wnw sqm /
      → wsp
      «
        @ All speeds in knots, equivalent airspeed
        2 wsp * 1.225 clp * / √ 0.51444444444 /
        kvc wsp 47.88025898 / √ *
        2 wsp * 1.225 cln ABS * / √ 0.51444444444 /
        kng nli * NEG
        2 wsp * 1.225 cgb * cla * 9.80665 * /
        → vss vcc vs0 nng mug
        «
          vss nli √ *
          vcc kvd *
          vs0 nng ABS √ *
          0.88 mug * 5.3 mug + /
          → vaa vdd vnn kgu
          «
            kgu 1.225 * 15.24 * vcc * 0.51444444444 * cla * 2 wsp * / 1 +
            kgu 1.225 * 7.62 * vdd * 0.51444444444 * cla * 2 wsp * / 1 +
            → ngc ngd
            «
              @ Scales: V from 0 to 1.08·VD, n with a margin of 0.4
              nli ngc MAX 0.4 +
              nng 2 ngc - MIN 0.4 -
              → nmx nmn
              «
                352 vdd 1.08 * /
                214 nmx nmn - /
                → sxv syv
                «
                  14 nmx syv * +
                  → ynz
                  «
                    ClearLCD
                    @ Axes
                    0 sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nmx syv * - IP R→B 2 →List 0 sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nmn syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    0 sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vdd 1.08 * sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    "V" vdd 1.08 * sxv * 34 + -14 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - -18 + IP R→B 0 true false 1 1 7 →List DrawText
                    @ Gust lines, thin
                    0 sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 1 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vcc sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz ngc syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    vcc sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz ngc syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vdd sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz ngd syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    0 sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 1 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vcc sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 2 ngc - syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    vcc sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 2 ngc - syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vdd sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 2 ngd - syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    vdd sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz ngd syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vdd sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 2 ngd - syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    @ Maneuvers
                    2 LineWidth
                    vss sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vss sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 1 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    1 19 FOR ii
                      1 nli 1 - ii 1 - * 19 / + 1 nli 1 - ii * 19 / +
                      → naa nbb
                      «
                        vss naa √ * sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz naa syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vss nbb √ * sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nbb syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                      »
                    NEXT
                    vaa sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nli syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vdd sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nli syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    vdd sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nli syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vdd sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    vdd sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vcc sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nng syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    vcc sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nng syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vnn sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nng syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    vs0 sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vs0 sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz -1 syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                    1 9 FOR ii
                      1 nng ABS 1 - ii 1 - * 9 / + 1 nng ABS 1 - ii * 9 / +
                      → naa nbb
                      «
                        vs0 naa √ * sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz naa NEG syv * - IP R→B 2 →List vs0 nbb √ * sxv * 34 + IP R→B ynz nbb NEG syv * - IP R→B 2 →List DrawLine
                      »
                    NEXT
                    'LineWidth' Purge
                    @ Labels
                    "Vst" vss sxv * 34 + -8 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - 4 + IP R→B 0 true false 1 1 7 →List DrawText
                    "VA" vaa sxv * 34 + -8 + IP R→B ynz nli syv * - -20 + IP R→B 0 true false 1 1 7 →List DrawText
                    "VC" vcc sxv * 34 + -8 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - 4 + IP R→B 0 true false 1 1 7 →List DrawText
                    "VD" vdd sxv * 34 + -8 + IP R→B ynz 0 syv * - 4 + IP R→B 0 true false 1 1 7 →List DrawText
                    "nlim" 0 sxv * 34 + 4 + IP R→B ynz nli syv * - -18 + IP R→B 0 true false 1 1 7 →List DrawText
                    "nneg" 0 sxv * 34 + 4 + IP R→B ynz nng syv * - -20 + IP R→B 0 true false 1 1 7 →List DrawText
                    "thin: gusts" vaa sxv * 34 + 6 + IP R→B ynz 1 syv * - -8 + IP R→B 0 true false 1 1 7 →List DrawText
                    vss 1_knot * "Vst" →TAG
                    vaa 1_knot * "VA" →TAG
                    vcc 1_knot * "VC" →TAG
                    vdd 1_knot * "VD" →TAG
                    ngc "nGC" →TAG
                    ngd "nGD" →TAG
                  »
                »
              »
            »
          »
        »
      »
    »
  »
»
